  "query_preview": "(Sunday through Wednesday)...\nA low pressure system moving inland through the western states\nwill maintain drier southwest flow aloft. High temperatures on\nSunday will be as much as 4 to 8 degrees below average for the\nInland Empire. High temperatures on Sunday will range from the mid\nto upper 70s near the coast to the mid to upper 80s for the Inland\nEmpire with 100 to 104 for the lower deserts. Low temperatures\nwill be mostly in the 50s for the inland valleys with the coast\ninto the western valley in the 60s. Patchy night and morning\ncoastal low clouds will spread into the far western valleys at\ntimes.",
